# Google Custom Search API Configuration (for inline image search)
# 1. Create API key: https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials
# 2. Enable Custom Search API
# 3. Create Search Engine: https://programmablesearchengine.google.com/
# 4. Copy your API key and Search Engine ID here:
VITE_GOOGLE_API_KEY=your_google_api_key_here
VITE_GOOGLE_CSE_ID=your_custom_search_engine_id_here
